    <Major>Auto Punch Wall Sim</Major>
    <Description>Automate the Roblox experience of Punch Wall Simulator.

Features:
~ Punches
~ Trains
~ Rebirths
~ Hatch eggs (optional)

Optional Requirements (if you also want it to hatch eggs):
~ A computer that supports multiple desktops
~ 2 Roblox accounts open (download from Roblox(dot)com and from an app store like Microsoft Store)

Setup:
~ Desktop 1 loaded with the account training and punching
~ (Optional) Desktop 2 loaded with the account farming pets
~ Both on the Punch Wall Simulator experience by axelodev
~ Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
